	('84580ce3-2f38-43e3-bea2-b42e4241e834', 'TVET Test 5 (Adaptability)', 'Duration: 15mins', '[{"type":"Multiple Choice","comment":null,""options":[{""option":"Panic and announce a postponement, potentially delaying the launch\'s momentum.","option_id":1,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Dive into technical troubleshooting, working with developers to identify and fix the issue efficiently.","option_id":2,""is_correct":true},{""option":"Ignore the problem and hope it resolves itself, focusing on other launch activities.","option_id":3,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Publicly apologize and offer partial refunds, potentially damaging trust and brand image.","option_id":4,""is_correct":false}],""question":"Scenario 1: Adaptability\nYou\'re the project manager for \""Tech Trek,\"" a highly anticipated educational app designed to ignite middle schoolers\' passion for science and technology. After months of meticulous planning, launch day arrives! But the universe has other plans:\n1. Download Disaster: Technical glitches cause the app to download at a snail\'s pace, frustrating eager users and generating a wave of angry online reviews.\n2. Content Crunch: A critical educational partner withdraws their content at the last minute, leaving a significant gap in the app\'s learning modules.\n3. Marketing Mayhem: Your carefully planned social media campaign gets overshadowed by a trending meme unrelated to your app, hindering initial user engagement.\n4. Budget Blues: Unexpected server load due to the overwhelming response overwhelms your hosting costs, threatening financial sustainability.\n5. Feature Fallout: Users discover a minor but annoying bug in the app, prompting negative feedback and concerns about overall quality.\n\nQuestion 1: When download speeds plummet, your immediate action is:\n","image_url":null,""slider_max":null,""slider_min":null,""is_required":false,""num_ratings":null,""question_id":1,""allow_recording":false,""media_file_type":"Image","slider_interval":1,""allow_multiple_files":false,""allow_multiple_selection":false},{""type":"Multiple Choice","comment":null,""options":[{""option":"Scrape the internet for similar content, potentially infringing on copyrights and compromising quality. ","option_id":1,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Contact alternative educational partners, leveraging your existing network to secure replacement content. ","option_id":2,""is_correct":true},{""option":"Temporarily remove the affected modules and prioritize fixing the other features, risking incomplete user experience.","option_id":3,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Blame your partner publicly and delay the launch indefinitely, damaging professional relationships.","option_id":4,""is_correct":false}],""question":"Question 2: Faced with the content gap, you:\n","image_url":null,""slider_max":null,""slider_min":null,""is_required":false,""num_ratings":null,""question_id":2,""allow_recording":false,""media_file_type":"Image","slider_interval":1,""allow_multiple_files":false,""allow_multiple_selection":false},{""type":"Multiple Choice","comment":null,""options":[{""option":"Abandon your planned strategy and scramble to copy the trending meme, risking brand dilution.","option_id":1,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Analyze the meme\'s appeal and adapt your content to incorporate relevant elements creatively.","option_id":2,""is_correct":true},{""option":"Increase ad spending in a desperate attempt to overpower the competition, potentially straining the budget.","option_id":3,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Stop all marketing efforts and wait for the trend to pass, losing valuable initial engagement.","option_id":4,""is_correct":false}],""question":"Question 3: When your marketing campaign falls flat, you:\n","image_url":null,""slider_max":null,""slider_min":null,""is_required":false,""num_ratings":null,""question_id":3,""allow_recording":false,""media_file_type":"Image","slider_interval":1,""allow_multiple_files":false,""allow_multiple_selection":false},{""type":"Multiple Choice","comment":null,""options":[{""option":"Cut corners on other project aspects, potentially compromising user experience and app quality. ","option_id":1,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Contact investors and explain the situation, seeking additional funding to sustain the app\'s growth.","option_id":2,""is_correct":true},{""option":"Implement temporary cost-saving measures while exploring long-term, affordable hosting solutions.","option_id":3,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Ignore the issue and hope the user surge subsides eventually, risking financial crisis.","option_id":4,""is_correct":false}],""question":"Question 4: To handle the unexpected hosting costs, you:\n","image_url":null,""slider_max":null,""slider_min":null,""is_required":false,""num_ratings":null,""question_id":4,""allow_recording":false,""media_file_type":"Image","slider_interval":1,""allow_multiple_files":false,""allow_multiple_selection":false},{""type":"Multiple Choice","comment":null,""options":[{""option":"Downplay its significance and promise a \""fix later\"" approach, risking further frustration and potential user churn. ","option_id":1,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Acknowledge the bug publicly, provide a timeline for the fix, and offer alternative functionalities in the meantime. ","option_id":2,""is_correct":true},{""option":"Focus on promoting the app\'s positive features and ignore the negative feedback, potentially damaging user trust.","option_id":3,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Blame beta testers for not catching the bug earlier and delay any fix indefinitely.","option_id":4,""is_correct":false}],""question":"Question 5: When users report the bug, you: ","image_url":null,""slider_max":null,""slider_min":null,""is_required":false,""num_ratings":null,""question_id":5,""allow_recording":false,""media_file_type":"Image","slider_interval":1,""allow_multiple_files":false,""allow_multiple_selection":false},{""type":"Multiple Choice","comment":null,""options":[{""option":"Resist the change, emphasizing the original plan\'s importance.","option_id":1,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Accept the change but express frustration with the disruption.","option_id":2,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Embrace the change, reevaluate priorities, and collaborate with the team on a revised plan.","option_id":3,""is_correct":true},{""option":"Comply with the change without seeking input from the team.","option_id":4,""is_correct":false}],""question":"Scenario 2: Adaptability\nYou are a team member at Dynamic Solutions Inc., a company known for its innovative projects. Answer the following multiple-choice questions based on your flexibility to adjust to changing needs and unforeseen circumstances.\n\nQuestion 1: Midway through a project, the client requests a change in project priorities. How do you respond?","image_url":null,""slider_max":null,""slider_min":null,""is_required":false,""num_ratings":null,""question_id":6,""allow_recording":false,""media_file_type":"Image","slider_interval":1,""allow_multiple_files":false,""allow_multiple_selection":false},{""type":"Multiple Choice","comment":null,""options":[{""option":"Refuse to use the new technology, sticking to familiar tools.","option_id":1,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Seek extensive training before using the new technology.","option_id":2,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Proactively learn about the new technology and integrate it into your workflow.","option_id":3,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Delegate tasks involving the new technology to team members more comfortable with it.","option_id":4,""is_correct":true}],""question":"Question 2: A project you are working on requires adopting a new technology unforeseen at the project\'s outset. How do you approach this challenge?","image_url":null,""slider_max":null,""slider_min":null,""is_required":false,""num_ratings":null,""question_id":7,""allow_recording":false,""media_file_type":"Image","slider_interval":1,""allo