e},{""option":"None of the above","option_id":5,""is_correct":false}],""question":"In a certain community there are 100 married couples. Two thirds of the husbands who are taller than their wives are also heavier, and three quarters of the husbands who are heavier than their wives are also taller. If there are 120 wives who are taller and heavier than their husbands, how many husbands are taller and heavier than their wives? ","image_url":null,""slider_max":null,""slider_min":null,""is_required":false,""num_ratings":null,""question_id":12,""allow_recording":false,""media_file_type":"Image","slider_interval":1,""allow_multiple_files":false,""allow_multiple_selection":false},{""type":"Open-ended","comment":null,""options":[],""question":"A woman spent one-sixth of her life in childhood, one-twelfth in youth, and one-seventh as a single woman. Five years after she got married, a son was born who died four years before his mother at half his motherâs final age. What was the womanâs final age? ","image_url":null,""slider_max":null,""slider_min":null,""is_required":false,""num_ratings":null,""question_id":13,""allow_recording":false,""media_file_type":"Image","slider_interval":1,""allow_multiple_files":false,""allow_multiple_selection":false},{""type":"Open-ended","comment":null,""options":[],""question":"A cereal company is offering a harmonica to anyone who sends in enough box tops. Gillian and Tess each want a harmonica. Tess needs seven more box tops and Gillian needs one more. They thought of combining their box tops to get one harmonica, but they still donât have enough. How many box tops are needed for one harmonica? ","image_url":null,""slider_max":null,""slider_min":null,""is_required":false,""num_ratings":null,""question_id":14,""allow_recording":false,""media_file_type":"Image","slider_interval":1,""allow_multiple_files":false,""allow_multiple_selection":false},{""type":"Multiple Choice","comment":null,""options":[{""option":"50 dollars","option_id":1,""i