_id":3,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Say yes to the date even though you donât care for them, because it would be rude to refuse.","option_id":4,""is_correct":false}],""question":"You recently changed jobs and one of your old co-workers calls you on the telephone and asks you out on a date. He/she is aware that you are not in a relationship at the moment. You enjoyed his/her conversations but you have no attraction to this person. You: ","image_url":null,""slider_max":null,""slider_min":null,""is_required":false,""num_ratings":null,""question_id":8,""allow_recording":false,""media_file_type":"Image","slider_interval":1,""allow_multiple_files":false,""allow_multiple_selection":false},{""type":"Multiple Choice","comment":null,""options":[{""option":"Say nothing.","option_id":1,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Strenuously veto the idea.","option_id":2,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Mention that you donât like that place and see if they are open to going somewhere else. ","option_id":3,""is_correct":false}],""question":"It is Friday afternoon and a few of your coworkers are planning on going out after work and you are really interested in joining them. A few suggestions on places to go are put forth, and after a co-worker suggests a specific place, everyone agrees. You do not like this place at all. However. You:","image_url":null,""slider_max":null,""slider_min":null,""is_required":false,""num_ratings":null,""question_id":9,""allow_recording":false,""media_file_type":"Image","slider_interval":1,""allow_multiple_files":false,""allow_multiple_selection":false},{""type":"Multiple Choice","comment":null,""options":[{""option":"Say nothing and let him continue to talk.","option_id":1,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Tell him that the problem was his entire fault.","option_id":2,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Sympathize with his situation, explain what happened, and how to correct the problem.","option_id":3,""is_correct":false}],""question":"You are a sales representative and one of your customers calls you on the phone. He is quite upset and verbal. When he tells YOU the problem, you realize the mistake is actually his fault. You: ","image_url":null,""slider_max":null,""slider_min":null,""is_required":false,""num_ratings":null,""question_id":10,""allow_recording":false,""media_file_type":"Image","slider_interval":1,""allow_multiple_files":false,""allow_multiple_selection":false},{""type":"Multiple Choice","comment":null,""options":[{""option":"Donât say anything and fix the problems yourself.","option_id":1,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Tell them they did it wrong and to do it over again.","option_id":2,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Show them which parts of it they did correctly and those which need to be fixed. ","option_id":3,""is_correct":false}],""question":"You are the manager and you ask one of your employees to do some work on a project for you. The employee returns the work to you and it is done incorrectly. You:","image_url":null,""slider_max":null,""slider_min":null,""is_required":false,""num_ratings":null,""question_id":11,""allow_recording":false,""media_file_type":"Image","slider_interval":1,""allow_multiple_files":false,""allow_multiple_selection":false},{""type":"Multiple Choice","comment":null,""options":[{""option":"I want to talk to your boss right now.","option_id":1,""is_correct":false},{""option":"You must be having a rough day today.","option_id":2,""is_correct":false},{""option":"Thatâs not how you speak to customers.","option_id":3,""is_correct":false},{""option":"I know, but weâre in a hurry. Please find him and send him over.","option_id":4,""is_correct":false},{""option":"I know youâre busy too. If you happen to see him, could you ask him to come over? ","option_id":5,""is_correct":false}],""question":"You are taking clients out to a business lunch to discuss a proposal. The clients have a very small budget and you donât feel that they are worth spending much time on. Your food ha